id: pm-vcs-9ssn
title: Certify pm CLI 2026.9.10 and pick up the canonical auditor fixes the lockfile was holding back
description: "CI runs the repo-pinned binaries, so the pins decide what the gates exercise. Advance @unbrained/pm-cli from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.10, the published npm latest, and pm-ops from 2026.9.7 to 2026.9.9. The pm-ops range already read as a caret, so this repository read as tracking the canonical publish-attestation auditor; it was not, because npm ci installs the lockfile and the lockfile pinned 2026.9.7. Measured with the 38-case bypass corpus, this repository admitted seven fail-open constructions at the locked version and is clean at 2026.9.9, with the launcher unchanged."
